{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-mat-9-1","title":"Matthew 9:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Christ cures one sick of the palsy; 9 calls Matthew from the receipt of custom; 10 eats with publicans and sinners; 14 defends his disciples for not fasting; 20 cures the bloody issue; 23 raises from death Jairus' daughter; 27 gives sight to two blind men; 32 heals a dumb man possessed of a devil; 36 and has compassion on the multitude.</p>\n<p>he. 7:6; 8:18,23; Mr 5:21; Lu 8:37; Re 22:11 his. 4:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-9-2","title":"Matthew 9:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>they brought. 4:24; 8:16; Mr 1:32; 2:1-3; Lu 5:18,19; Ac 5:15,16; 19:12 seeing. 8:10; Mr 2:4,5; Lu 5:19,20; Joh 2:25; Ac 14:9; Jas 2:18 Son. 22; Mr 5:34; Joh 21:5 be. Ps 32:1,2; Ec 9:7; Isa 40:1,2; 44:22; Jer 31:33,34; Lu 5:20; 7:47-50 Ac 13:38,39; Ro 4:6-8; 5:11; Col 1:12-14 thy sins.Rather, \"thy sins are forgiven thee;\" the words being an affirmation, not a prayer or wish. The word be, however, was used by our translators in the indicative plural for are. As the palsy is frequently produced by intemperance, it is probable, from our Lord's gracious declaration, that it was the case in the present instance.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-9-3","title":"Matthew 9:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>certain. 7:29; Mr 2:6,7; 7:21; Lu 5:21; 7:39,40 This. 26:65; Le 24:16; Mr 14:64; Joh 10:33-36; Ac 6:11-13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-9-4","title":"Matthew 9:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>knowing. 12:25; 16:7,8; Ps 44:21; 139:2; Mr 2:8; 8:16,17; 12:15; Lu 5:22 Lu 6:8; 7:40; 9:46,47; 11:17; Joh 2:24,25; 6:61,64; 16:19,30; 21:17 Heb 4:12,13; Re 2:23 Wherefore. Eze 38:10; Ac 5:3,4,9; 8:20-22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-9-5","title":"Matthew 9:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>whether. Mr 2:9-12; Lu 5:23-25 Arise. Isa 35:5,6; Joh 5:8-14,17,18; Ac 3:6-11,16; 4:9,10; 9:34; 14:8-11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-9-6","title":"Matthew 9:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>that the. Isa 43:25; Mic 7:18; Mr 2:7,10; Lu 5:21; Joh 5:21-23; 10:28; 17:2 Joh 20:21-23; Ac 5:31; 7:59,60; 2Co 2:10; 5:20; Eph 4:32; Col 3:13 Arise. 5; Lu 13:11-13; Ac 9:34</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-9-8","title":"Matthew 9:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>when. 12:23; 15:31; Mr 2:12; 7:37; Lu 5:26; 7:16 and. 15:31; Lu 5:25; 17:15; 23:47; Ac 4:21; Ga 1:24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-9-9","title":"Matthew 9:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>named. 21:31,32; Mr 2:14-17; Lu 5:27,28 Levi. Lu 15:1,2; 19:2-10 Follow. 4:18-22; 1Ki 19:19-21; Ga 1:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-9-10","title":"Matthew 9:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>as. Mr 2:15,16,17; Lu 5:29-32 many. 5:46,47; Joh 9:31; 1Ti 1:13-16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-9-11","title":"Matthew 9:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>they said. Mr 2:16; 9:14-16 Why. 11:19; Isa 65:5; Lu 5:30; 15:1,2; 19:7; 1Co 5:9-11; Ga 2:15 Heb 5:2; 2Jo 1:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-9-12","title":"Matthew 9:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>They that be whole. Ps 6:2; 41:4; 147:3; Jer 17:14; 30:17; 33:6; Ho 14:4; Mr 2:17; Lu 5:31 Lu 8:43; 9:11; 18:11-13; Ro 7:9-24; Re 3:17,18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-9-13","title":"Matthew 9:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>go. 12:3,5,7; 19:4; 21:42; 22:31,32; Mr 12:26; Lu 10:26; Joh 10:34 I will. Pr 21:3; Ho 6:6; Mic 6:6-8 to call. 18:11-13; Mr 2:17; Lu 5:32; 15:3-10; 19:10; Ro 3:10-24 1Co 6:9-11; 1Ti 1:13-16 but. 3:2,8; 4:17; 11:20,21; 21:28-32; Isa 55:6,7; Lu 15:7; 24:47 Ac 2:38; 3:19; 5:31; 11:18; 17:30,31; 20:21; 26:18-20; Ro 2:4-6 1Ti 1:15; 2Ti 2:25,26; 2Pe 3:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-9-14","title":"Matthew 9:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>the disciples. 11:2; Joh 3:25; 4:1 Why. 6:16; 11:18,19; Pr 20:6; Mr 2:18-22; Lu 5:33-39; 18:9-12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-9-15","title":"Matthew 9:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>Can. 25:1-10; Jud 14:11-20; Ps 45:14,15; Joh 3:29; Re 19:9; 21:2 when. Lu 24:13-21; Joh 16:6,20-22; Ac 1:9,10 and then. Isa 22:12; Ac 13:1-3; 14:23; 1Co 7:5; 2Co 11:27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-9-16","title":"Matthew 9:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>new cloth. or, raw, or unwrought cloth. for. Ge 33:14; Ps 125:3; Isa 40:11; Joh 16:12; 1Co 3:1,2; 13:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-9-17","title":"Matthew 9:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>old. Jos 9:4; Job 32:19; Ps 119:83</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-9-18","title":"Matthew 9:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>behold. Mr 5:22-43; Lu 8:41-56 ruler. Lu 8:49; 13:14; 18:18; Ac 13:15 worshipped. 8:2; 14:33; 15:25; 17:14; 20:20; 28:17; Mr 5:22; Lu 17:15,16 Ac 10:25,26 My daughter. 24; Mr 5:23; Lu 7:2; 8:42,49; Joh 4:47-49 come. 8:8,9; 2Ki 5:11; Joh 11:21,22,25,32</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-9-19","title":"Matthew 9:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>8:7; Joh 4:34; Ac 10:38; Ga 6:9,10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-9-20","title":"Matthew 9:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>behold. Mr 5:25-43; Lu 8:43-56 an issue. Le 15:25-33 touched. 14:36; Mr 5:28; 6:56; 8:22; Ac 5:15; 19:12 hem. 23:5; Nu 15:38,39; De 22:12; Lu 8:44</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-9-21","title":"Matthew 9:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>If. Mr 5:26-33; Lu 8:45-47; Ac 19:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-9-22","title":"Matthew 9:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>Daughter. 2; Mr 5:34; Lu 8:48 thy. 29; Mr 10:52; Lu 7:50; 17:19; 18:42; Ac 14:9; Heb 4:2 from. 17:18; Joh 4:53; Ac 16:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-9-23","title":"Matthew 9:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>into. 18,19; Mr 5:35-38; Lu 8:49-51 the minstrels. 11:17; 2Ch 35:25; Jer 9:17-20; Mr 5:38-40; Lu 7:32; Ac 9:39</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-9-24","title":"Matthew 9:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>Give. 1Ki 17:18-24; Ac 9:40; 20:10 not. Joh 11:4,11-13 And. 27:39-43; Ps 22:6,7; Isa 49:7; 53:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-9-25","title":"Matthew 9:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>the people. 2Ki 4:32-36; Ac 9:40,41 and took. Mr 1:31; 5:41; 8:23; 9:27; Lu 8:54</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-9-26","title":"Matthew 9:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>the fame hereof. or, this fame. 4:24; 14:1,2; Mr 1:45; 6:14; Ac 26:26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-9-27","title":"Matthew 9:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>two. 11:5; 12:22; 20:30; Mr 8:22,23; 10:46; Lu 7:21; Joh 9:1-12 Thou. 12:23; 15:22; 20:30,31; 21:9,15; 22:41-45; Mr 10:47,48; 11:10 Mr 12:35-37; Lu 18:38,39; 20:41; Joh 7:42; Ro 1:3; 9:5 have. 17:15; Mr 9:22; Lu 17:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-9-28","title":"Matthew 9:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>come. 8:14; 13:36 Believe. 22; 8:2; 13:58; Mr 9:23,24; Joh 4:48-50; 11:26,40</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-9-29","title":"Matthew 9:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>touched. 20:34; Joh 9:6,7 According. 8:6,7,13; 15:28; Mr 10:52</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-9-30","title":"Matthew 9:30","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":30,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":30},"content":"<p>their. Ps 146:8; Isa 35:5; 42:7; 52:13; Joh 9:7-26 straitly. 8:4; 12:16; 17:9; Mr 5:43; Lu 5:14; 8:56</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-9-31","title":"Matthew 9:31","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":31,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":31},"content":"<p>spread. Mr 1:44,45; 7:36</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-9-32","title":"Matthew 9:32","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":32,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":32},"content":"<p>a dumb. 12:22,23; Mr 9:17-27; Lu 11:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-9-33","title":"Matthew 9:33","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":33,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":33},"content":"<p>the dumb. 15:30,31; Ex 4:11,12; Isa 35:6; Mr 7:32-37; Lu 11:14 It. 2Ki 5:8; Ps 76:1; Jer 32:20; Lu 7:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-9-34","title":"Matthew 9:34","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":34,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":34},"content":"<p>12:23,24; Mr 3:22; Lu 11:15; Joh 3:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-9-35","title":"Matthew 9:35","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":35,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":35},"content":"<p>4:23,24; 11:1,5; Mr 1:32-39; 6:6,56; Lu 4:43,44; 13:22 Ac 2:22; 10:38</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-9-36","title":"Matthew 9:36","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":36,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":36},"content":"<p>when. 14:14; 15:32; Mr 6:34; Heb 4:15; 5:2 fainted, etc. or, were tired and lay down. as. 10:6; 15:24; Nu 27:17; 1Ki 22:17; 2Ch 18:16; Isa 56:9-11; Jer 50:6 Eze 34:3-6; Zec 10:2; 11:16; 13:7,8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-9-37","title":"Matthew 9:37","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":37,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":37},"content":"<p>The harvest. 28:19; Mr 16:15; Lu 10:2; 24:47; Joh 4:35,36; Ac 16:9; 18:10 but. Ps 68:11; 1Co 3:9; 2Co 6:1; Php 2:19-21; Col 4:11; 1Th 5:12,13 1Ti 5:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-9-38","title":"Matthew 9:38","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":38,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":38},"content":"<p>Pray. Lu 6:12,13; Ac 13:2; 2Th 3:1 the Lord. 10:1-3; Joh 20:21; Eph 4:11 that. Ps 68:11,18; Jer 3:15; Mic 5:7; Lu 10:1,2; Ac 8:4; 1Co 12:28</p>"}]}